  "2026-07-24T12:14:54.015Z",claude-code-agent,"Closeout correction: the published pm-changelog generator intentionally includes closed Plan items and does not consume a changelog-exclude tag. Removed the misleading tag, updated the plan wording, and regenerated CHANGELOG.md only through pnpm changelog:pm; no product implementation changed."
  "2026-07-24T12:17:14.451Z",claude-code-agent,"Final dedupe refinement: active exact-title and parent-scope audits are clean. The fuzzy audit reports six Semgrep-only clusters (29 items), but full-record sampling shows distinct external finding IDs and distinct argument flows at shared source locations. Recorded the result on canonical parent pm-oz8u and explicitly superseded the earlier zero-fuzzy shorthand; no items were merged or closed."
