plan_resume_context: Start with pm context and full live metadata. Treat pm-hcrmye as the current measured performance regression and pm-feecbs as the external-fleet conformance gap. Reuse the linked canonical epics for every other workstream; do not create a new broad umbrella or weaken any gate.
