  "Final pre-publication tracker checks passed: health clean, normalize proposes zero active changes, merge reconciliation dry-run finds zero drift, storage integrity and merge fence clean, exact/fuzzy/parent-scope active duplicates zero, graph has zero active isolates and only informational legacy findings, every mutated history stream verifies.",pm health; pm normalize --dry-run; pm merge reconcile --dry-run; pm graph audit --summary; pm dedupe-audit; pm history --verify --strict-exit,"No actionable integrity, history, graph, or duplicate failures."
