  plan-step-001,1,"Reconstruct live tracker state, goals, metadata, history, and canonical ownership",completed,"2026-07-24T12:06:36.781Z","2026-07-24T12:07:51.142Z","Inspected all-status counts, context, open and in-progress sets, full canonical item metadata, comments, notes, learnings, histories, hierarchy, dependencies, activity range, and current GitHub/npm state; reused the living roadmap.","2026-07-24T12:07:51.142Z"
  plan-step-002,2,"Review CLI grammar, agent UX, output token cost, contracts, and customization",completed,"2026-07-24T12:06:36.781Z","2026-07-24T12:07:51.840Z","Measured 75 root names versus 63 canonical contract summaries, exercised error recovery and help, sampled TOON payload sizes, inspected runtime contracts, schema, profiles, agent guidance, and customization lineages; mapped all simplification work to pm-n7rr.","2026-07-24T12:07:51.840Z"
  plan-step-003,3,"Review public SDK completeness, extension authoring, type boundaries, and exemplars",completed,"2026-07-24T12:06:36.781Z","2026-07-24T12:07:52.489Z","Verified the zero-private-core presentation boundary, public package exports, SDK-only exemplars, extension lifecycle and authoring docs, typed runtime contracts, and external import paths; maintainability findings map to quality owners rather than missing SDK primitives.","2026-07-24T12:07:52.489Z"
