  plan-step-005,5,"Review performance, security, dependencies, and multi-agent merge and lock semantics",completed,"2026-07-24T12:06:36.781Z","2026-07-24T12:07:53.859Z","Ran real-tracker timings, the deterministic scale gate, full quality/security/dependency gates, and reviewed merge drivers, history reconciliation, collision detection, lock races, init behavior, and GitHub security/CI status; created focused regression pm-hcrmye.","2026-07-24T12:07:53.859Z"
