  plan-step-007,7,Deduplicate findings and record only focused gaps under canonical parents,completed,"2026-07-24T12:06:36.781Z","2026-07-24T12:07:55.309Z","Ran all-status duplicate searches for each candidate and reused pm-n7rr, pm-usfg, pm-yh8r, pm-kb5h, pm-hous, pm-quzx, pm-92if, and security/multi-agent lineages. Only pm-hcrmye and pm-feecbs were net-new focused gaps.","2026-07-24T12:07:55.309Z"
  plan-step-008,8,Validate tracker integrity and publish the tracker-only result directly to main,completed,"2026-07-24T12:06:36.781Z","2026-07-24T12:10:40.976Z","All pre-publication checks passed. Tracker-only roadmap commit b7bb0db6ab8c5cb637425e1ce52b020b02cfe7ae was pushed directly to main; after fetch, local HEAD and origin/main matched exactly. GitHub created no workflow run for this tracker-only commit.","2026-07-24T12:10:40.976Z"
body: "This plan records the current whole-system review under the philosophy project management = context management. Core behavior is unusually well protected: literal all-source coverage, zero local code clones, public SDK boundary enforcement, contract generation, token budgets, security scans, isolated package dogfood, and merge-aware git storage. The most important delivery principle is simplification without capability loss: consolidate presentation grammar, decompose implementation modules and folders, and single-source package policy while retaining every typed SDK primitive, compatibility alias, storage invariant, and history record.\n\nRecommended delivery order:\n- Restore the fixed 10k latency and RSS budgets through pm-hcrmye; continue pm-801d and the scale program after the regression is understood.\n- Execute the accepted noun-verb grammar and tiered-discovery sequence under pm-n7rr, preserving hidden aliases and contract parity.\n- Decompose saturated files through pm-yh8r and reorganize high-fan-out domain folders through pm-kb5h while keeping public SDK exports stable.\n- Retain pm-usfg as the functional SDK completeness contract; use pm-f4yn, pm-j8vq, and the quality/security lineages for maintainability and analyzer debt.\n- Establish pm-feecbs under the trust ladder, then apply pm-quzx dependency and canonical-package decisions across all official packages.\n- Prioritize open mutation races pm-khdq and pm-zwib plus fresh-init/merge-fence issues before claiming conflict-free multi-agent operation at fleet scale.\n- Preserve authoritative TOON item documents, append-only attributable history, semantic merge drivers, strict reconciliation, bounded context outputs, and SDK-first implementation in every tranche.\n\nNo product implementation source, tests, dependencies, workflows, thresholds, or release assets are changed by this plan. The package-owned generator refreshes CHANGELOG.md because closed Plan items are part of the current changelog contract."
